<title>NEW ZEALAND: RUGBY UNION-FREE STATE BEAT OTAGO 49-18.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-FREE STATE BEAT OTAGO 49-18.</headline>
<dateline>INVERCARGILL, New Zealand 1997-03-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Orange Free State Cheetahs beat the Otago Highlanders 49-18 (halftime 21-15) in their super 12 rugby union match on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Free State - Tries: Naka Drotske (2), Chris Badenhorst (2), Braam Els, Os du Randt, Andre Venter. Conversions: Jannie de Beer (7).</p>
<p>Otago - Penalties: Simon Culhane (6).</p>
